          body: `If the report surfaced anything stale or missing (plugin behind, SDK out of date or on the legacy \`bitfab\` package, or replay registry modules missing/incomplete), {{askVerb}} whether to apply them, each fix is then confirmed individually in the next step (nothing is changed blanket). If everything is healthy, skip the question and go straight to cleanup.

{{branches}}`,
